{"channelId":"UC6SfitBIyO-V4jCHhg16kTg","row":["Animal Shelter",559000,"Is it true that the more developed our society, the more heartless we humans become? As more and more dogs are being abused, abused and abandoned by humans.\nDogs are our friends, they are always loyal and love us unconditionally. Whether we are rich or poor, we are strong or weak, they will be with us until the very end.\nAnimal Shelters is a place where animal lovers can meet and talk, listen to inspirational stories about dogs with extraordinary energy, and inspire people to fall in love with them.\nIf you can, please support the rescuers with the information described under each video.\nWe are working every day so that we humans have more love and faith in the beautiful life.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6SfitBIyO-V4jCHhg16kTg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6SfitBIyO-V4jCHhg16kTg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:14.340Z","channelId":"UC6SfitBIyO-V4jCHhg16kTg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d6ad446a14ed3300e1ee57f372740d6bd3f8a78337ea81e137537ccc770a4a34","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"48f5026f1a7edc738e115df6dd5526a810fc76a10b3fd67dbb765e8715f9e3fc"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6SfitBIyO-V4jCHhg16kTg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":559000,"raw":"559K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6SfitBIyO-V4jCHhg16kTg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:14.340Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"rong or weak, they will be with us until the ve